/*!
@defgroup soc_mipi_dsi MIPI DSI SOC Driver
@details The MCUXpresso SDK provides SoC-specific definitions for the MIPI DSI
driver on MCUXpresso SDK devices.

This component supplies the device-level glue used by the generic MIPI DSI
driver, including:
  - D-PHY PLL VCO output frequency limits (DSI_DPHY_PLL_VCO_MIN /
    DSI_DPHY_PLL_VCO_MAX)
  - Driver-version macro and component-ID definition

*/
